{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Mealify 2.0 是一款結合食材庫存管理與餐單規劃的飲食助理，適合忙碌家庭、學生、備餐人士及希望減少浪費的家居煮食者。它可透過照片掃描食材、整理庫存、發掘食譜並自動生成購物清單；原價 US $24.99，現正終生版<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-182.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>掃描食材自動規劃餐單</h2>\n<p>Mealify 2.0 可從單張照片掃描食材，快速建立食材庫存並持續管理項目。用戶能整理、篩選及發掘食譜，查看現有食材可煮的菜式，亦可建立每週餐單，再自動轉為購物清單。程式同時提供收藏與儲存食譜、偵測缺少食材等功能，適合希望減少浪費、節省開支或更快決定煮甚麼的人士。</p>\n<figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-216-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-217-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-218-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-219-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-220-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-221-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure>\n</figure>\n<h2>限時免費領取終生版</h2>\n<p>Mealify 2.0 終生版內購限時免費中，用戶完成初始化後看到收費牆，Lifetime 價格顯示為$0 即可免費收下。注意，如果看到價格不是 $0 代表限免已完結，請勿按付費確認。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Mealify 2.0</li>\n<li>應用類別：Food &amp; Drink</li>\n<li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/mealify-2-0/id6746368726\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li>\n</ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T08:18:31.292241+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":416,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T07:53:19+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T06:14:28.922785+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T08:11:52.708618+00:00","content_hash":"d81bada10ff1267bc0cda546d1cec37f9e5180f0902f5279fa219a8b6dbe0e6a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}